[Music]  east town is a  mixture of a number of different towns  in pennsylvania  around where i grew up and i wanted the  show to be about a certain place in the  world  a certain group of people these people  have been born here  they've been raised here and now they're  raising their children here  that sense of history and shared history  united history  that is very apparent in this particular  area of east town  is quite unique i would say um and  everyone knows a little bit about what  someone else is up to  and there's always the sort of resident  slightly annoying  character mayor would have to deal with  where hey out there  oh you're here i'm here we shot  primarily in what i would call an  excerpt of philadelphia  kind of like the southwestern area  outside chester county and delaware  county  and that really did inform so much it  was nice to kind of be  in a place that felt like america and it  wasn't so specifically a big  city we wanted to make sure that the  vibe of the show  and the feeling of east town was  specific in many different ways  we did it through location we would try  to pick a location that was  true to what it really was not just the  most picturesque  [Applause]  we would do it with costume our custom  designer would constantly be texting me  pictures from the wawa convenience store  just of people in the line the clothes  really all felt  lived in to me and of that place  for instance i mean i had i think a dave  matthews concert  t-shirt and like certain things that  maybe you won't even see on camera but  those little details for her  and for the actors are important  i wanted the show to have a grittiness  to it you have to have an honesty to it  to have a realness to it  these are people that get up every  morning and go to jobs they don't  necessarily love  but they do it out of a sense of duty  so i wanted to portray these communities  that exist that don't often get  any time on the screen in a way that was  heroic and noble and also really  sympathetic  we're asking parents if their child  might have seen something  please come forward every bit of  information helps at this point  what's beautiful about this story is  that it isn't just about the crime it  isn't just about the mystery and who's  done it  but it's about the families you have the  opportunity to sort of investigate all  the families and to see the effects that  the crime has had and get involved in  everybody's personal stories and see how  they're interwoven  so there's something kind of heightened  you know in the drama i suppose when it  is a small town  you're pushing everyone away  including you no i won't let you  the show is very much about compassion  and mercy  and looking out for your friends and  your neighbours and it's quite special  in that regard  very moving in that regard  you

